An abbreviation definition in an item body is paragraph text

```
- a

  *[A]: a
.
<ul>
  <li>a</li>
</ul>
```

```
- a

  *[A]: a
  - b
.
<ul>
  <li>a
    <ul>
      <li>b</li>
    </ul>
  </li>
</ul>
```

```
- a

  *[A]: a
  - b
- c
.
<ul>
  <li>a
    <ul>
      <li>b</li>
    </ul>
  </li>
  <li>c</li>
</ul>
```

```
- a

  [r]: /u

See [x][r].
.
<ul>
  <li>a</li>
</ul>
<p>See <a href="/u">x</a>.</p>
```

```
*[A]: alpha

A here
.
<p><abbr title="alpha">A</abbr> here</p>
```
